 bronze between France’s " [:a {:href ""} "Marc-Antoine Oliver"] " and China’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/133203"} "Zu Lijun"] ", with Oliver getting the nod. Jack Burnell (GBR) was also in that photo for bronze medal but he was disqualified for interfering with Mellouli near the line. Wilimovsky was a few seconds back in fifth place, while Mellouli finished 12th."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {} "Lap 1"] [:th {} "Lap 2"] [:th {} "Lap 3"] [:th {} "Lap 2 Split"] [:th {} "Lap 3 Split"] [:th {} "Lap 4 Split"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/135285"} "Ferry Weertman"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NED"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NED.png"}] "NED"]] [:td {} "1-52:59.8"] [:td {} "29:47.2 (19)"] [:td {} "58:21.8 (10)"] [:td {} "1-26:01.1 (15)"] [:td {} "28:34.6 (5)"] [:td {} "27:39.3 (14)"] [:td {} "26:58.7 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/93497"} "Spyros Gianniotis"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GRE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GRE.png"}] "GRE"]] [:td {} "1-52:59.8"] [:td {} "29:48.7 (22)"] [:td {} "58:26.9 (21)"] [:td {} "1-26:00.4 (13)"] [:td {} "28:38.2 (13)"] [:td {} "27:33.5 (=4)"] [:td {} "26:59.4 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/133910"} "Marc-Antoine Olivier"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "1-53:02.0"] [:td {} "29:46.1 (18)"] [:td {} "58